@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### Health check — overall
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health check — liveness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health check — readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Diagnostics snapshot (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag

### Get current dev session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devsession

### Create anonymous guest session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devsession/anon

### Logout / clear dev session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/devsession
